# MappableSeq instance: fmap applies a function over a Seq.
# The instance method dict is callable directly.
[
  inst: [instance Mappable [pattern [Seq]]:
    fmap: [fn [f xs] [builtin-map f xs]]]
  result: [collect [inst.fmap [fn [x] [+ x 10]] [builtin-range 0 3]]]
]
=== out
Dict({"inst": Dict({"fmap": Function(f, xs)}), "result": Dict({0: Int(10), 1: Int(11), 2: Int(12)})})
